// # CFI Fail-Closed Stubs
//
// Logline: Fail-closed process_exit residuals for hardware CET, kernel kCFI table, ARM PAC, and IBT endbr patch.
//
// Setup: Default-deny per RULES.oot 1.4 (require &SysCap). oodac lacks x86_64 prctl / MSR FFI, kernel kCFI table bindings, and ARM PAC inline-assembly lowering.
//
// Beats:
//   1. cfi_enable_hardware_cet_sys: refuse x86_64 ARCH_SET_CPUID / Intel CET MSR setup.
//   2. cfi_register_kernel_kcfi_table_sys: refuse kernel kCFI function pointer table registration.
//   3. cfi_read_arm_pac_key_sys: refuse ARM PAC APIAKey / APDBKey register read.
//   4. cfi_patch_binary_ibt_endbr_sys: refuse ELF ENDBR64 / ENDBR32 opcode injection.
//   5. process_exit(1): default-deny on unbuilt kernel FFI surface.
//   6. SysCap / Fail / Default: zero-sized capability shims for the residual surface.
//
// residual: not a real CFI pass; integrate host platform runtime.

import "./cfi_engine.oo";

// -------------------------------------------------------------------
// Fail-Closed Hardware, Kernel & Architecture Direct Access Stubs
